SUMMARY:✨ THE SANCTUARY WITHIN SOUND BATH✨
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n**✨ THE SANCTUARY WIT
 HIN SOUND BATH✨**\n🍂 **Sunday\\\, October 18 \\| 3:00–4:00 PM**\n
 📍 **Center for Spiritual Living Asheville — Sanctuary**\n📌 2 Scien
 ce of Mind Way\, Asheville\n\nAs the world around us begins to quiet\, aut
 umn invites us inward. 🍁\n\n**Come home to calm.**\n**Come home to your
 self.**\n**Come home to the Sanctuary Within.** 🕊️\n\nJoin us for a d
 eeply relaxing hour of soothing sound and vibration designed to help you r
 elease tension\, quiet the mind\, and create space for **peace\, balance\,
  and deep restoration.**\n\nAllow yourself to unplug from the outside worl
 d and reconnect with the quiet\, peaceful place within you. ✨\n\n🧘 **
 Bring:**\n• Yoga mat\n• Pillow\n• Blanket\n• Eye mask\n⏰ **Pleas
 e arrive 15 minutes early** to settle in and claim your spot.\n💚 **Slid
 ing Scale:** $10–$20\n🌿 **First come\, first served**\n\nYou don’t 
 have to go anywhere to find your way home.\n\n**Your sanctuary is already 
 within you.** 💫\n#SoundBath #TheSanctuaryWithin #SoundHealing #DeepRela
 xation #Meditation #Mindfulness #InnerPeace #SpiritualWellness #SelfCare #
 AshevilleEvents #AshevilleWellness #CommunityCommonsAsheville
