SUMMARY:🌄 Remembering Together: The Power of Spiritual Community
DESCRIPTION:Center for Spiritual Living Asheville\n# 🌄 Remembering Toge
 ther: The Power of Spiritual Community\n\n✨ **An Interactive Workshop wi
 th Forrest Rivers** ✨\n\n📅 **Wednesday\, October 21st**\n🕡 **6:30 
 PM**\n📍 **Center for Spiritual Living Asheville**\n2 Science of Mind Wa
 y\, Asheville\, NC 28806\n\nWhat is the power of coming together in spirit
 ual community? ❤️\nIt has been called by many names: *Sangha\, Church\
 , Satsang\,* and spiritual community. Whatever name we use to describe thi
 s sacred gathering of souls\, one thing is certain: coming together in spi
 ritual community can be a powerful and transcendent experience.\n\nJoin wo
 rkshop facilitator **Forrest Rivers** for an engaging\, highly interactive
  exploration of why we are drawn to gather with fellow spiritual seekers a
 nd how these connections can deepen our relationship with the living spiri
 t.\n\n🌿 **Together\, we'll explore questions such as:**\n✨ Why are we
  drawn as spiritual seekers to gather in the spirit?\n🙏 How does meetin
 g in Sangha (spiritual community) draw us closer to a deeper relationship 
 with the living spirit?\n💜 How do we find a spiritual community that tr
 uly resonates with our own unique journey?\n\nThrough heartfelt discussion
 \, group chanting and sacred music\, and contemplative exercises\, we'll e
 xplore these questions together and discover the transformative possibilit
 ies of spiritual connection.\n\nAs Ram Dass so beautifully expressed\, the
  true power of spiritual community lies in remembering that:\n\n💜 *“W
 e are all just walking each other home.”*\n\nCome share in an evening of
  connection\, reflection\, music\, and spiritual discovery. Whether you're
  already part of a spiritual community or seeking a place where you feel a
  deeper sense of belonging\, you're invited to join us!\n\n🌟 **We look 
 forward to remembering together!**\n\n#RememberingTogether #SpiritualCommu
 nity #Sangha #SpiritualGrowth #HeartfeltConnection #ConsciousLiving #Cente
 rForSpiritualLivingAsheville #CommunityCommonsAsheville
